{"book":"Revelation","chapter":9,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/revelation/9","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"And the fifth angel sounded, and I saw a star fall from heaven unto the earth: and to him was given the key of the bottomless pit.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["the fifth",["G3991"]],["angel",["G32"]],["sounded,",["G4537"]],["and",["G2532"]],["I saw",["G1492"]],["a star",["G792"]],["fall",["G4098"]],["from",["G1537"]],["heaven",["G3772"]],["unto",["G1519"]],["the earth:",["G1093"]],["and",["G2532"]],["to him",["G846"]],["was given",["G1325"]],["the key",["G2807"]],["of the bottomless",["G12"]],["pit.",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"And he opened the bottomless pit; and there arose a smoke out of the pit, as the smoke of a great furnace; and the sun and the air were darkened by reason of the smoke of the pit.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["he opened",["G455"]],["the bottomless",["G12"]],["pit;",["G5421"]],["and",["G2532"]],["there arose",["G305"]],["a smoke",["G2586"]],["out of",["G1537"]],["the pit,",["G5421"]],["as",["G5613"]],["the smoke",["G2586"]],["of a great",["G3173"]],["furnace;",["G2575"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the sun",["G2246"]],["and",["G2532"]],["the air",["G109"]],["were darkened",["G4654"]],["by reason of",["G1537"]],["the smoke",["G2586"]],["of the pit.",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"And there came out of the smoke locusts upon the earth: and unto them was given power, as the scorpions of the earth have power.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["there came",["G1831"]],["out of",["G1537"]],["the smoke",["G2586"]],["locusts",["G200"]],["upon",["G1519"]],["the earth:",["G1093"]],["and",["G2532"]],["unto them",["G846"]],["was given",["G1325"]],["power,",["G1849"]],["as",["G5613"]],["the scorpions",["G4651"]],["of the earth",["G1093"]],["have",["G2192"]],["power.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"And it was commanded them that they should not hurt the grass of the earth, neither any green thing, neither any tree; but only those men which have not the seal of God in their for